The plan involves setting up an Express server that listens on port 5000, initializing an SQLite database to store recipes, comments, and ratings, and defining API endpoints for retrieving an overview of recipes, uploading new recipes, retrieving specific recipes by ID, adding comments, and rating recipes. Each endpoint will handle requests and responses, including error handling for invalid inputs and not found cases.

